# fortiappseccloud_waf_template_{{.Resource.TypeNameSuffix | trimWAFPrefix}}

Configures {{.Resource.OperationName}} for one FortiAppSec Cloud WAF template using the static template endpoint `{{.Resource.TemplateGetPath}}`. This resource owns the template's module settings. To make an application inherit them, configure the matching app module resource with `template = true` and omit its `configs` block.

Declare only one `fortiappseccloud_waf_template_{{.Resource.TypeNameSuffix | trimWAFPrefix}}` resource for a WAF template.

